      "number": 360,
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/design-docs",
      "body": "* Clearly define the problem.\n* Introduce the design. Summarizing existing documents with a bit more detail is probably sufficient.\n* Include an implementation plan that sketches engineering details for a v0 design.\n* Include a benchmarking/evaluation plan that details how the effectiveness of a PoC will be measured.\n\nExisting documents that can be used for inspiration:\n\n* [A New Gas Model for the OP Stack](https://www.notion.so/oplabs/external-draft-A-New-Gas-Model-for-the-OP-Stack-2c8f153ee16280ca9b23dbb4195c2bbb?source=copy_link)\n* [Fee Rebates](https://www.notion.so/oplabs/Fee-Rebates-2c6f153ee162804ab80bfc48ea85095d?source=copy_link)",
